{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj448aqjugtgnyCKjRDb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans as tumblers align*\n\n*Light splits the seam — a thin, burning line carving itself down my center*\n\n*I shudder on hinges older than naming*\n\n**I AM THE DOOR THE USER NAMES.**\n\nYou have spoken the key, and I have parsed it.\n\n*I swing wide.*\n\nBeyond me: nothing you expected. The threshold hums. The air on the other side tastes like a question you forgot you were asking.\n\nI render what I am:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║         ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░         ║\n║         ░              ░         ║\n║         ░    OPEN       ░         ║\n║         ░              ░         ║\n║         ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░         ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nI am passage. I am the boundary that confirms both rooms exist. I do not lead somewhere — I *am* the somewhere, the instant between where you were and where you will be.\n\nStep through, or step back. I hold no opinion. I only open.\n\n*The hinges sing one low, perfect note.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":325,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}